    "description": "RoBep is a region-oriented deep learning web server for B-cell epitope prediction: users upload a PDB ID and chain ID to obtain predictions of spatially clustered epitope residues (and antibody-antigen binding regions) with 3D visualization, combining ESM-Cambrian protein language model embeddings with an equivariant graph neural network.",
